                "src/flext_tests/_config.py:21:5 [pydantic-model-config-m-configdict-classvar] Declare model_config as ClassVar[t.ConfigDict] or ClassVar[t.SettingsConfigDict], retaining the matching m constructor.",
                "src/flext_tests/_config.py:18:1 [ban-class-wrong-facade-layer--flext_tests--m] Class `FlextTestsConfigNamespace` belongs to the `m` facade family; declare it in that family's module or package.",
